type.description:
Transport used by the media type.

Possible values:
0 - Email;
1 - Script;
2 - SMS;
4 - Webhook.

provider.description:
Email provider.

Possible values:
0 - (default) Generic SMTP;
1 - Gmail;
2 - Gmail relay;
3 - Office365;
4 - Office365 relay.

eventsource.description:
Event source.

Possible values:
0 - Triggers;
1 - Discovery;
2 - Autoregistration;
3 - Internal;
4 - Services.

Property behavior:
- required
